{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"3881a71e-03c6-4e9a-8cb1-b9d7e41d0716","level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"HeptaSync — 專案總覽"}]},{"type":"blockquote","attrs":{"id":"7795e1c2-0c10-4120-9076-372dcc654421"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"b8f0c5a0-8d02-4c2f-a02c-fde08fb43db6"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"非官方社群工具,不隸屬 Heptabase。完全建構在官方 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"heptabase"},{"type":"text","text":" CLI 之上,不直接碰 Heptabase 的資料庫或內部檔案。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"3d805fa3-b064-4835-a5a9-c3c8c8ca7e07"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"本文件由 HeptaSync 自己同步上 Heptabase —— 這張卡片就是工具運作的活見證。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"e201a5b7-5629-481c-9e96-62a0092c08fc","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. 這是什麼"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"2a596adf-322b-49b7-b0d6-73a0f705a517"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"讓 AI agent(或你自己)可以"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"像編輯純文字檔一樣"},{"type":"text","text":"整理 Heptabase 筆記:改本地的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":".md"},{"type":"text","text":" 檔,變更就同步回 Heptabase。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"2f78cd7d-4603-446b-bcd4-98cca9e76ec4","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. 解決的問題"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"40bbc59d-0f32-40e6-9726-b92527b7e544"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"官方 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"heptabase"},{"type":"text","text":" CLI 能"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"新建"},{"type":"text","text":"卡片、能在卡片"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"尾端追加"},{"type":"text","text":",但"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"不能用純文字(markdown)修改既有卡片的中間"},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"note save"},{"type":"text","text":" 要的是 Heptabase 內部的 ProseMirror 格式)。結果:agent 只能幫你「加」,不能幫你「改寫 / 整理」。HeptaSync 補的就是這個洞。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"d1487dd4-0315-4f18-bf24-3905e8b9969a","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. 運作方式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"934eda3b-7c5f-4107-8651-3bb4538cf22f"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"Pull(拉下來):"},{"type":"text","text":" 卡片 → 讀出 ProseMirror JSON → 轉成 Markdown → 寫成本地 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":".md"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"536d0231-ffc2-426e-ba3d-d8138d545ae8"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"Push(推上去):"},{"type":"text","text":" 用「移植 (transplant)」這招繞過格式問題 ——"}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"cec54b7d-d2b7-4a51-b4ff-66453a1a3682","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"23c8d9d9-ffd1-4a04-a338-dbcfca5612e4"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"把編輯後的 markdown 丟給 Heptabase,讓它自己建一張暫時卡(借它的手做格式轉換)。"}]}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"fc127d6c-e6dd-44c3-96fd-aa5f975184a6","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"ff4546cc-0ceb-4472-815a-e014461e15e2"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"把原卡的 block 編號「移植」到沒被改動的 block 上 —— Heptabase 才知道「還是同一塊,只是內容改了」。"}]}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"7fa9f1a8-dd7d-4144-b3d4-8516b4caa173","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"b795e47b-5845-4f88-869b-c4901c5f86f3"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"存回原卡,刪掉暫時卡。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"b42a0f8c-3360-4cf6-9f1e-cd99e4d08d97"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"好處:"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"我們完全不用自己懂 Heptabase 的內部格式。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"354e58eb-d10e-4ecb-8379-b926b7e91fa5"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"每個本地 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":".md"},{"type":"text","text":" 檔最上面有一段隱藏的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"heptabase:"},{"type":"text","text":" frontmatter,記住它對應哪張卡片。預覽 markdown 時看不見。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"3322fcd5-6957-4382-8c2f-